        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/application/check-processing-times.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Check processing times (method, 80% rule, biometrics included), IRCC</a></li>
