        <li><a href="https://ircc.canada.ca/english/information/fees/fees.asp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Fee list, IRCC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/visit-canada/apply-visitor-visa.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Apply for a visitor visa, IRCC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/application/application-forms-guides/imm5257.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Application for visitor visa (IMM 5257), IRCC</a></li>
